## Key Differences: Client vs Admin SDK

| Aspect | Client SDK | Admin SDK |
|--------|-----------|-----------|
| Import | `firebase/firestore` | `firebase-admin/firestore` |
| Database | `db` from client-init | `adminDb` from server-init |
| Collection | `collection(db, 'name')` | `adminDb.collection('name')` |
| Document | `doc(collection, 'id')` | `collection.doc('id')` |
| Get | `await getDoc(docRef)` | `await docRef.get()` |
| Set | `await setDoc(docRef, data)` | `await docRef.set(data)` |
| Update | `await updateDoc(docRef, data)` | `await docRef.update(data)` |
| Query | `query(collection, where(...))` | `collection.where(...)` |
| Timestamp | `Timestamp.now()` | `Timestamp.now()` |
| Context | Requires browser auth | Uses service account |

